My Winnipeg is a documentary, drama, comedy film directed by Guy Maddin.

3
00:14:07,058 --> 00:14:13,058
The geographical dead center of North America and the beloved birthplace of Guy
Maddin, Winnipeg, is the frosty and mysterious star of Maddin’s film.

4
00:18:49,411 --> 00:18:55,411
Fact, fantasy and memory are woven seamlessly together in this work,
conjuring a city as delightful as it is fearsome.

